        <dc:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2023-05-24T11:33:36Z</dc:date>
        <dc:description>A relation between a specifically dependent continuant (the dependent) and an independent continuant (the bearer), in which the dependent specifically depends on the bearer for its existence.</dc:description>
