    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/clarisse/ontologies/2023/5/CompleteOntoContextV11#City -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/clarisse/ontologies/2023/5/CompleteOntoContextV11#City">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ogms.owl#SCTO_223496003"/>
        <rdfs:comment>Describes a specific city or cities that the study can be conducted in.

A city is an area in which a large number of people live fairly close together. Cities usually have their own separate governments and systems for maintaining and providing utilities and transportation.
https://www.vocabulary.com/dictionary/city</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/clarisse/ontologies/2023/5/CompleteOntoContextV11#Continent -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/clarisse/ontologies/2023/5/CompleteOntoContextV11#Continent">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ogms.owl#SCTO_223496003"/>
        <rdfs:comment>Describes a continent or continents that the study can be conducted in.

continent, one of the larger continuous masses of land, namely, Asia, Africa, North America, South America, Antarctica, Europe, and Australia, listed in order of size
https://www.britannica.com/science/continent</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/clarisse/ontologies/2023/5/CompleteOntoContextV11#Country -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/clarisse/ontologies/2023/5/CompleteOntoContextV11#Country">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ogms.owl#SCTO_223496003"/>
        <rdfs:comment>Describes a specific country or countries that the study can be conducted in.

A country is a spatially clearly delimited area, in which its own administration with at least partial autonomy comes to bear, which emanates from an organization exercising power
https://www.worlddata.info/definition-country.php</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/clarisse/ontologies/2023/5/CompleteOntoContextV11#Province -->

